{"id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","title":"Generic Filter","display":"df-generic-filter — Generic Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generic-filter","aliases":["58-df-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-forcing2-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-boolean-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-forcing4-generic-filter","58-df-zfc-forcing8-generic-filter"],"display":"df-generic-filter — Generic Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generic-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing2-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-boolean-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing4-generic-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-generic-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic-filter — Generic Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" href=\"?note=bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,G,B,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(M,P,G,B,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S,\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S,\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" href=\"?note=bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2GenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2GenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanGenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4GenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanGenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing4GenericFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic-filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\,(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic-filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall D\\in M\\,(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}order\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\;\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}order\\text{-}implicit} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\;\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingGenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing2} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing2} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,P,M,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}boolean} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanGenericFilter}_S(G,B,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,B,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}boolean} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanGenericFilter}_S(G,B,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,B,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing4} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4GenericFilter}_S(M,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing4} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing4GenericFilter}_S(M,P,G)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing8} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}filter\\text{-}alias\\text{-}forcing8} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GenericFilter}_S(G,P,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Generic filter 与所有稠密子集相交</li>\n<li>它在脱殊扩张中生成新集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> 表示由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 生成的脱殊扩张</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-generic-filter</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-forcing-generic-filter</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-forcing2-generic-filter</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]).","embed":fa